[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_n2mby")
messageID = 14
title = "Rescue Will Come"
message = "Will here hope my message in a bottle reaches downstream, my theory is correct, the water from the mining section does grow bigger up north which means it eventually leads outside but the journey is far

Hauling all the injured here might not be the best move. I will reach emergency services to clear up the rubble blocking the entrance but I'm afraid I don't know how long this journey will take

Once water supplies run out try to make a makeshift water filter using the rocks, some sand you can find lying around and coal stacked on a layer. That'll remove the contaminants

As for food, please ration the food available, you can make a pot from all the iron we already have to cook whats raw from the barbaque were supposed to have.

[NEW Building: Water Filter Lv2]
[NEW Building: Cookplace Lv2]"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://clg6sgwgkl1xk"
